<title>UK: Atlantic Telecom lines rise to 9,322 in Q1.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Telecom lines rise to 9,322 in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Atlantic Telecom Group Plc said on Tuesday the number of its telecommunications lines rose to 9,322 at end-March from 5,315 at end-December.</p>
<p>The firm said it had doubled the number of operational base stations to 30 by the end of March, representing about one-third of the total required to complete its network. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
